#### Coding Hints ###########################################################

Ex07 is about templating: basic string manipulation to create HTML from
component parts. The model solution uses an array of strings, but there are,
as usual, many different valid solutions (inc. reusing 3rd party libraries).

Ex08 needs to use WiFiClientSecure, talk to the server (detailed on
Blackboard, or create your own) on the specified port, and get the URL and
paths correct. Under those circumstances it will return a line of text
